  "notes": [
    "Skyrim Special Edition on the Anniversary Edition runtime (1.6.x / 1.7.x, tested on 1.7.104) with SKSE64 and the Address Library (All in one, AE). Not SE 1.5.97, not VR.",
    "Start Minecraft first, then Skyrim through skse64_loader.exe. They link through shared memory; Minecraft drives the player, Skyrim draws everything.",
    "The SIGF app starts the Minecraft side first as its own Prism instance, then the game through its script extender loader (Steam is opened first when it is not running).",
    "Play from a save made after Helgen, or with Alternate Start. Mods that take over the camera (Improved Camera SE, SmoothCam, True Directional Movement) conflict."
  ]
